{"id":"persona","lemma":"persona","pos":"noun","rank":220,"glosses":["person (an individual; usually a human being)","a socially distinguished person, a personality","a wise or otherwise excellent person"],"ipa":"/peɾˈsona/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"personas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-persona.wav","formAudio":{"personas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-personas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tú eres una persona.","en":"You're a person.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734296"},{"text":"Pocas personas piensan así.","en":"Few people think so.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44705"},{"text":"¿Soy una mala persona?","en":"Am I a bad person?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/637152"},{"text":"¿Quiénes son estas personas?","en":"Who are these people?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/41272"},{"text":"Elige a una persona.","en":"Choose one person.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444386"}]}